s/v1/","context":{"app_id":4618670,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4618670-1847286114042757","game_id":"steam-4618670","kind":"update","title":"Big Demo Update: Every System Unlocked, Smoother Battles, Safer Saves","summary":"Hello, cultivators! Thank you for all the feedback in the community over the past few days — we read every post. This update fixes the issues you reported and adds quite a few improvements. 🔓 Everything is playable in the demo - The Forge, Academy, Workshop, Town and every other system are now open. The demo is limited only to the first map. - Fixed the third main quest getting stuck because the Forge could not be opened. ⚔️ Fairer, more fun battles - Stun, freeze and other hard crowd control no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T19:08:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042757","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:13:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618670-1847286114040931","game_id":"steam-4618670","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Performance and Gameplay Improvements","summary":"Hello, cultivators! This Demo update includes the following improvements: Performance: Optimized game loading, interface responsiveness and combat processing, reducing repeated loading and calculations. Combat: Added status icons and active skill names, improved floating combat text and refined transitions between regular floors. Interface: Improved the inventory, equipment and forging screens, standardized number formatting and refined English text layout. Fixes: Resolved issues with equipment ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:16:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040931","verified_at":"2026-10-25T04:02:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618670-1847286114038019","game_id":"steam-4618670","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Performance and Quality-of-Life Improvements","summary":"Greetings, cultivators! The latest Demo update is now live. This update focuses on performance, inventory and equipment controls, and the early-game experience, alongside a range of combat and UI fixes. Performance and Loading Optimized loading during startup and scene transitions. Optimized damage, visual effects and loot processing in combat to reduce unnecessary repeated calculations. Reduced unnecessary refreshes in the inventory, equipment and other screens to improve responsiveness when yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T21:26:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038019","verified_at":"2026-10-24T00:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618670-1847286114033454","game_id":"steam-4618670","kind":"announcement","title":"Full-Game Screenshots: Fiercer Horde Combat, Very Different from the Demo!","summary":"Greetings, cultivators! Here is a new look at gameplay from the full game currently in development! Take on hordes of enemies with a five-member party, and put your team builds and character progression into action. From class skill combinations to equipment, cultivation manuals and realm progression, the full game brings further changes and additions built around horde combat. The combat experience is now very different from the current Demo. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46109368/bcbd2e54cb6569d8d04afcb2","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:42:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033454","verified_at":"2026-10-22T21:14:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4618670-1846651706679578","game_id":"steam-4618670","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Forge Improvements and Combat Power Display","summary":"The latest Demo update is now live. Updated the forge interface, with clearer crafting, tempering and dismantling controls and information. Added character and party Combat Power displays to help compare character development and equipment choices. Fixed errors when switching certain crafting categories and missing interface textures. Please keep sharing bugs and any controls you find confusing or unnecessarily complicated. Thank you for playing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:28:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679578","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4618670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4618670":"2026-10-26T03:15:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4618670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4762410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:15:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4618670","app_id":4618670,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:43Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2c4f5ff2f5c5